{"no":10,"title":"Not for Jazz","titleZh":"不适于演奏爵士乐","audio":"audio/L10.mp3","duration":79.94,"question":{"en":"What happened to the clavichord?","zh":"那架古钢琴怎么了？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":14.59,"t2":20.26,"en":"What happened to the clavichord?","zh":"那架古钢琴怎么了？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":20.26,"t2":24.48,"en":"We have an old musical instrument.","zh":"我家有件古乐器。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"have instrument","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"an old musical instrument","g":"形容词修饰名词"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般现在时","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":2,"t":24.48,"t2":28.49,"en":"It is called a clavichord.","zh":"它被叫做古钢琴。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"is called clavichord","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a clavichord","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["被动语态","主谓句型"]},{"i":3,"t":28.49,"t2":33.1,"en":"It was made in Germany in 1681.","zh":"它是1681年德国制造的。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was made","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in Germany","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in 1681","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["被动语态","主谓句型"]},{"i":4,"t":33.1,"t2":36.76,"en":"Our clavichord is kept in the living room.","zh":"我们的这架古钢琴存放在起居室里。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"is kept","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in the living room","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the living room","g":"冠词+名"},{"c":"NP","x":"Our clavichord","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["被动语态","主谓句型"]},{"i":5,"t":36.76,"t2":41.47,"en":"It has belonged to our family for a long time.","zh":"我们家有这件乐器已经很久了。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"has belonged","g":"完成时态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"for a long time","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"to our family","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a long time","g":"冠词+形+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["现在完成时","主谓句型"]},{"i":6,"t":41.47,"t2":47.54,"en":"The instrument was bought by my grandfather many years ago.","zh":"这件乐器是我祖父在很多年以前买的。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was bought ago","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"by my grandfather","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"The instrument","g":"冠词+名"},{"c":"NP","x":"my grandfather","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["被动语态","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":7,"t":47.54,"t2":51.45,"en":"Recently it was damaged by a visitor.","zh":"可它最近被一个客人弄坏了。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"Recently was damaged","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"by a visitor","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a visitor","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["被动语态","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":8,"t":51.45,"t2":55.13,"en":"She tried to play jazz on it!","zh":"因为她用它来弹奏爵士乐！","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"to play jazz","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"tried play","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"on it","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","不定式","感叹句"]},{"i":9,"t":55.13,"t2":62.23,"en":"She struck the keys too hard and two of the strings were broken.","zh":"她在击琴键时用力过猛，损坏了两根琴弦。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"struck keys hard","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"were broken","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of the strings","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"ADJP","x":"too hard and","g":"形容词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["一般过去时","被动语态","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":10,"t":62.23,"t2":65.42,"en":"My father was shocked.","zh":"我父亲大为吃惊。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was shocked","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"My father","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","主系表句型"]},{"i":11,"t":65.42,"t2":68.28,"en":"Now we are not allowed to touch it.","zh":"现在不许我们再碰它。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"Now are not allowed touch","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"VP","x":"to touch it","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["被动语态","不定式","否定的 not"]},{"i":12,"t":68.28,"t2":78.28,"en":"It is being repaired by a friend of my father's.","zh":"父亲的一个朋友正在修理它。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"is being repaired","g":"被动谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"by a friend of my father 's","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of my father 's","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"a friend","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般现在时","被动语态","主谓句型"]}]}